@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registro
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ale",
  "email": "ale@mail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login (copiar el token a los otros archivos .http)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ale@mail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login con credenciales incorrectas (401)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ale@mail.com",
  "password": "mala"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "email": "no-es-email",
  "password": "1"
}
